window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><strong>On the windswept coast of Maine, secrets buried in the past resurface with deadly consequences in theSunset Cove series by <em>USA TODAY</em> bestselling author Colleen Coble. Blending atmospheric suspense with emotional depth and faith-filled romance, each book delivers a riveting standalone mystery while unfolding the deep ties that bind the coastal town of Folly Shoals together.</strong></p><p><strong>Book One: <em>The Inn at Ocean's Edge</em></strong> She vanished for a year. Now she's remembering why. Claire Dellamare returns to the Hotel Tourmaline for a business trip--only to discover she disappeared from the very same hotel as a child. Now, repressed memories begin to resurface, and they don't add up with the story her parents have always told her. Teaming up with Luke Rocco--whose own mother disappeared the same year--Claire must unravel a tangled past before a killer ensures the truth stays buried forever.</p><p><strong>Book Two: <em>Mermaid Moon</em></strong> Her father's final words were a clue--and a warning. Mallory Davis left Mermaid Point fifteen years ago, burdened by tragedy and guilt. But when her father dies under suspicious circumstances, she returns home and finds herself in the crosshairs of a killer. Old wounds are reopened when her childhood love, Kevin O'Connor, is the only one she can trust to help unravel the mystery. As danger draws closer, Mallory must confront both her past and the possibility of a second chance at love.</p><p><strong>Book Three: <em>Twilight at Blueberry Barrens</em></strong> He needed a nanny. She needed a miracle. Neither expected danger. When Kate Mason's blueberry fields stop producing, she rents out her family's coastal cottage to a stranger--Drake Newham, a man investigating a series of deaths tied to his family. What begins as a business arrangement quickly turns into something more, even as threats mount around them. With a stalker lurking in the shadows and a fugitive uncle on the loose, Kate must decide if love is worth risking her life.</p><p><strong>With richly drawn characters, picturesque settings, and gripping suspense, the Sunset Cove series is perfect for fans of Terri Blackstock, Dani Pettrey, and romantic thrillers with a thread of faith. Includes discussion questions for book clubs.</strong></p>"; 
